.PP
The \f[V]dotnet tool install -g\f[R] command does still serve an important purpose for users who want to permanently install a tool.
However, for users who want to try out a tool or run it in a CI/CD pipeline, \f[V]dotnet tool exec\f[R] is often a better fit.
